{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstoolbartop"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"role":"symbol","title":"OUDSToolBarTop","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents14OUDSToolBarTopV","roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSToolBarTop"}],"platforms":[{"introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS","unavailable":false},{"introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"visionOS","unavailable":false}],"symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSToolBarTop"}]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarTop\/init(title:hasLargeTitle:subtitle:leadingItems:trailingItems:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarTop\/body(content:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarTop\/ViewModifier-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The top toolbar (aka "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"navigation bar"}]},{"type":"text","text":" on iOS and iPadOS 18 and lower) sits at the top of the screen and provides contextual information"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and controls related to the current view."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It typically displays the page title, and may include navigation actions such as “Back” or “Close” as well as supplementary actions."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can contains leading and trailing actions."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarTop"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSToolBarTop","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"toolBarTop(_:hasLargeTitle:subtitle:leadingItems:trailingItems:)"},{"type":"text","text":"  View helper applies a SwiftUI toolbar configuration."}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Appearances","type":"heading","text":"Appearances"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With Liquid Glass \/ iOS 26+ the OS will change the rendering of the toolbar items depending to the context:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The OS can group the items of same types in one group with kind of rectangle (e.g. views with menus)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"But for buttons items they will remain isolated"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The placement of the title can be leading or centered depending to the length of the text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The text can be truncated if there is not enough remaining space"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The OS can apply another style for the back button"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Without Liquid Glass \/ iOS 18 and lower, the OS won’t change that much the style of the toolbar items, Items won’t be visually grouped."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Globaly the appearence of the * navigation bar* elements is changed by the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"oudsNavigationBarAppearance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"helper of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" that must be applyed on the root view of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationStack"},{"type":"text","text":" for example."}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Technical-constraints","type":"heading","text":"Technical constraints"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To be sure for iOS 18 and lower the back buttton and text have the good color, in your main view apply the following accent color:"}]},{"code":["    struct AppMainView: View {","        var body: some View {","            ContentView()","                .accentColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","        }","    }"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Platform-considerations","type":"heading","text":"Platform considerations"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component is available on iOS, iPadOS, and visionOS"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component is not available for watchOS, tvOS and macOS"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Badges-uses","type":"heading","text":"Badges uses"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For iOS 26 with Liquid Glass, the system badge is used because the OUDS badge component does not provide a suitable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rendering with the glassified effect applied on the top toolbar."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For iOS until 18 and without Liquid Glass  OUDS badge component is always used."}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Code-sample","type":"heading","text":"Code sample"},{"code":["    ContentView()","        .toolBarTop(\"Title\",","            leadingItems: {","                OUDSToolBarItem(navigation: .back())","            },","            trailingItems: {","                OUDSToolBarItem(label: \"Label\") { \/* Action to process *\/ }","                OUDSToolBarItem(icon: Image(decorative: \"some_image\"), accessibilityLabel: \"Label\") { \/* Action to process *\/ }","            }","        )"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Design-documentation","type":"heading","text":"Design documentation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-ios-tool-bar-top","isActive":true}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Themes-rendering","type":"heading","text":"Themes rendering"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Liquid-Glass","type":"heading","text":"Liquid Glass"},{"level":4,"anchor":"Orange","type":"heading","text":"Orange"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Orange_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Orange_dark"}]},{"level":4,"anchor":"Orange-Compact","type":"heading","text":"Orange Compact"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_dark"}]},{"level":4,"anchor":"Sosh","type":"heading","text":"Sosh"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Sosh_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","ide